{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bed5e8fceaf7eee3","type":"group","x":-1880,"y":480,"width":2187,"height":1680,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"eeb4dc60ce04cf2a","type":"group","x":440,"y":-80,"width":1140,"height":960,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"df7901e164f7e719",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Youtube\nEntertainment-only\nGame-stories, movie recaps, news",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-3160,
			"y":-360,
			"width":480,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"9391dfb152a5e7b1","type":"file","file":"Temptations/_reflections/On YouTube.md","x":-3120,"y":-180,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"7a09005eaa7d3613",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Indulgence\nSelf-destructive pleasures",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2020,
			"y":-360,
			"width":480,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"66fcbec495c5783a","type":"file","file":"Temptations/_reflections/On Indulgence.md","x":-1980,"y":-180,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"2a53d1eb3f8e2d2d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## PMO\nAny kind of sexually stimulating activity. Watching/listening/doing/fantasizing",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2600,
			"y":-360,
			"width":480,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"b06065a132a65b27","type":"file","file":"Temptations/_reflections/On PMO.md","x":-2560,"y":-180,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"5946468f5b4961ee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Gluttony\nSweets & Fastfood",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1460,
			"y":-360,
			"width":480,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"9683fd9eba7bedbc","type":"file","file":"Temptations/_reflections/On Gluttony.md","x":-1420,"y":-180,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"87c3b8d6056d3f25",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Meaning, Hope & En-theos\nProved solution that overrides sources that ask for temptation. \nHard to achieve, but has guaranteed results. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1090,
			"y":-20,
			"width":420,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"0c32ad00106491e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Work\nMaking the ego strong enough to be able to have some indulgence once in a while without falling into \"the loop\"",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":466,
			"y":280,
			"width":289,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"13c459bd846b0e9e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Solutions",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":680,
			"y":100,
			"width":280,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"0c625dd4c301703c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Cold Turkey\nWhen you're doing it WHILE you have productive work - this creates a lot of meaning and hope for you. This can't be true if you're doing the wrong thing",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":880,
			"y":280,
			"width":420,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"abcb0109de53d14c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [The Plan - Temptations](ThePlan.canvas)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":63,
			"y":-360,
			"width":465,
			"height":100
		},
		{"id":"62e0c3eb73ef4b2a","type":"file","file":"Temptations/OverridingLog.md","x":735,"y":-660,"width":1445,"height":460},
		{
			"id":"77e98fc37c5a8ea7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Overriding Log",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":840,
			"y":-810,
			"width":370,
			"height":85
		},
		{
			"id":"e43d029a619df1df",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Reflections",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":131,
			"y":-840,
			"width":330,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dd441b5fcdd7a353",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```base\nfilters:\n  and:\n    - file.inFolder(\"ThePlan/Inner-Work/Temptations/_reflections\")\nviews:\n  - type: list\n    name: Reflections\n    order:\n      - file.name\n    sort:\n      - property: file.mtime\n        direction: DESC\n\n```\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":63,
			"y":-760,
			"width":457,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"b2ec18b48029ea72",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Awareness & Reflection\nWhen you're able to just pause and reflect on the reasons of the temptation, think about it, write about it, wait for 10-15 minutes - temptation usually subsides",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":610,
			"y":600,
			"width":420,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"dbb3de88ec392df3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Issues\n- **Solitaire-like** on hard mode you can have unwinnable streaks for a long time, while it's cognitively draining since you're trying to do win as fast as possible. So you're **actively offloading your brain** from the work while **exhausting cognitive resources**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1852,
			"y":1380,
			"width":465,
			"height":640
		},
		{
			"id":"588c13a874ed5368",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Visions of Superiority\nWhen things are going good, you're likely to have these visions which compensate for inferiority complex",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1840,
			"y":1190,
			"width":440,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"c7a6ea454bb90437",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Issues\n- **Harming the Anima** development, because you're creating a habit to see feminine only as sexual-relief thing, and by doing that you become blind to what makes the Anima unique and helpful partner in one's life. ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1651,
			"y":660,
			"width":685,
			"height":310
		},
		{
			"id":"892e203f09637672",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Games\nBoth, solitaire and other puzzles as well as normal video games",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1231,
			"y":1280,
			"width":387,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"189409207dadcefc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Common issues\n- When you're avoidant, looping through all of the indulgence allows you to **keep being avoidant**. Unconscious changes, you just do.\n- Jungian transcendent function can't be achieved because indulgence significantly drops the tension, even if it's only being as a available choice, not to mention giving in to it. ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-844,
			"y":920,
			"width":781,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"e461c7ddd9ccd452",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Issues\n- **Solitaire-like** on hard mode you can have unwinnable streaks for a long time, while it's cognitively draining since you're trying to do win as fast as possible. So you're **actively offloading your brain** from the work while **exhausting cognitive resources**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1270,
			"y":1460,
			"width":465,
			"height":640
		},
		{
			"id":"f54aef25339ffd9b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## PMO\nAny kind of sexually stimulating activity. Watching/listening/doing/fantasizing",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1651,
			"y":520,
			"width":619,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"963a809e82451bee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Issues\n- You can't have **hungry mornings** (hunger is false), so the day starts with indulgence loop\n- **Ordering** fast-food \"before I'll full dive into the work\" - wastes hours through waiting, eating, being in comatose state, and in the end it **never ends in productive work**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-720,
			"y":1460,
			"width":465,
			"height":640
		},
		{
			"id":"ca76c02333ab4501",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Youtube\nEntertainment-only\nGame-stories, movie recaps, news",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-681,
			"y":1280,
			"width":387,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"e6abb8e192238ad4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Issues\n- You can't have **hungry mornings** (hunger is false), so the day starts with indulgence loop\n- **Ordering** fast-food \"before I'll full dive into the work\" - wastes hours through waiting, eating, being in comatose state, and in the end it **never ends in productive work**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-170,
			"y":1460,
			"width":465,
			"height":640
		},
		{
